## Row (Layout)

Row fields arrange fields horizontally in the admin panel (presentational only).

```ts
import type { RowField } from 'payload'

const rowField: RowField = {
  type: 'row',
  fields: [
    {
      name: 'firstName',
      type: 'text',
      admin: { width: '50%' },
    },
    {
      name: 'lastName',
      type: 'text',
      admin: { width: '50%' },
    },
